# SIGNAL NULL — Claude Code Project Context

## Project Type
Electron + React + TypeScript Text Adventure Game

## Core Principles
- Game engine is PURE TypeScript (no React dependencies in /engine)
- Story content is DATA, not logic — keep story/*.ts as clean data objects
- MIRA system is event-driven, never blocks main thread
- All save data must go through saveManager.ts — NEVER direct fs writes
- Steam API calls only in main process, never renderer

## Architecture Rules
- IPC pattern: renderer dispatches actions → main handles → returns result
- GameEngine is a singleton, accessed via useGameEngine hook
- No inline styles — all styling via CSS Modules

## File naming
- Components: PascalCase.tsx
- Hooks: camelCase.ts with 'use' prefix
- Engine: PascalCase.ts
- Story nodes: camelCase chapter/ending name

## Current Phase
Phase 1 — Foundation complete. Engine, MIRA, Chapter 1 implemented.
Phase 2 — Chapters 2-5 content writing.
Phase 3 — Ending implementations.
Phase 4 — Audio, polish, Steam integration with greenworks.
Phase 5 — QA & ARG infrastructure.
